---
source: tests/fixtures.rs
expression: table
---
## . [pnpm-monorepo] JavaScript tools=pnpm
dev                      Development    declared exact  safe        .          pnpm run dev :: Run dev across packages with Turborepo
build                    Build          declared exact  safe        .          pnpm run build :: Run build across packages with Turborepo
test                     Testing        declared exact  safe        .          pnpm run test :: Run test across packages with Turborepo
lint                     Quality        declared exact  safe        .          pnpm run lint :: Run lint across packages with Turborepo
check                    Quality        declared exact  safe        .          pnpm run check :: Run typecheck in all workspace packages
release                  Release        declared exact  external    .          pnpm run release :: Publish packages with Changesets
changeset                Release        declared exact  safe        .          pnpm run changeset :: Create a changeset entry
## apps/mobile [mobile] JavaScript tools=pnpm
mobile                   Development    declared exact  safe        .          pnpm --filter mobile run start :: Start the Expo development server
mobile:ios               Development    declared exact  safe        .          pnpm --filter mobile ios :: Build and run the app on iOS
mobile:android           Development    declared exact  safe        .          pnpm --filter mobile android :: Build and run the app on Android
mobile:test              Testing        declared exact  safe        .          pnpm --filter mobile run test :: Run Jest tests
## apps/web [web] JavaScript tools=pnpm
web                      Development    declared exact  safe        .          pnpm --filter web dev :: Start the Vite development server
web:build                Build          declared exact  safe        .          pnpm --filter web build :: Build the app with Vite
web:test                 Testing        declared exact  safe        .          pnpm --filter web run test :: Run Vitest tests
web:lint                 Quality        declared exact  safe        .          pnpm --filter web lint :: Check source code with ESLint
web:typecheck            Quality        declared exact  safe        .          pnpm --filter web typecheck :: Check Vue and TypeScript types
## packages/config [@shop/config] JavaScript tools=pnpm
config:lint              Quality        declared exact  safe        .          pnpm --filter @shop/config lint :: Check source code with ESLint
